# Never publish generated output, diagnostic captures, backups or local checkouts.
/Github/
/logs/
/Tools/git/
/Research/
/Dump/
/CustomModifications/
**/dev-build/
**/build/
**/cache/
**/backup/
**/backups/
**/__pycache__/
